type: software
title: "FIADB.diRect: Direct Access to FIA PostgreSQL Databases"
abstract: >-
  R package for direct access to USDA Forest Inventory and Analysis (FIA)
  PostgreSQL databases and generation of FIA Green Book estimates, plot
  observations, tree observations, and custom record queries.
